### School Voting API — request collection
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or JetBrains HTTP client).
### Set @host to your deployment; run the requests top to bottom.

@host = http://localhost:8000
@adminEmail = admin@school.edu
@adminPassword = Admin123!

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Admin

### 1. Sign up (a verification code is emailed; with MAIL_MAILER=log it lands in storage/logs/laravel.log)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

### 2. Verify email with the emailed code → returns a token
POST {{host}}/api/admin/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "code": "123456" }

### 3. Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

@adminToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Forgot password → emails a reset code
POST {{host}}/api/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}" }

### 5. Reset password with the code → returns a token
POST {{host}}/api/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "code": "123456", "password": "NewPass123!" }

### ------------------------------------------------------------ Elections

### 6. Create election (admin)
# @name createElection
POST {{host}}/api/elections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Student Council Election 2026",
  "description": "Annual student council election",
  "allowedDomains": ["school.edu", "student.school.edu"]
}

@electionId = {{createElection.response.body.electionId}}

### 7. List my elections (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/elections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Election details (public)
GET {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}

### 9. Update election (admin, owner)
PATCH {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Student Council Election 2026 (updated)" }

### 10. Activate / deactivate (admin, owner)
PATCH {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": true }

### 11. Add candidate with photo (admin, owner) — multipart
# @name addCandidate
POST {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}/candidates
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Jane Doe
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bio"

Passionate leader
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="jane.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./jane.jpg
------Boundary--

@candidateId = {{addCandidate.response.body.candidateId}}

### 12. Candidates for an election (public)
GET {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}/candidates

### 13. All my candidates (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/elections/candidates
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Update candidate text (admin, owner)
PATCH {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bio": "Updated bio" }

### 15. Results (admin, owner)
GET {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 16. Delete candidate (admin, owner)
DELETE {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. Delete election (admin, owner)
DELETE {{host}}/api/elections/{{electionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------- Voting

### 18. Verify voter email → emails a code, returns sessionId
# @name verify
POST {{host}}/api/vote/{{electionId}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student@school.edu" }

@sessionId = {{verify.response.body.sessionId}}

### 19. Confirm code → returns a 15-minute vote token
# @name confirm
POST {{host}}/api/vote/{{electionId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}", "code": "123456" }

@voteToken = {{confirm.response.body.token}}

### 20. Cast vote
POST {{host}}/api/vote/{{electionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{voteToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "candidateId": "{{candidateId}}" }

### -------------------------------------------------------------- Monitor

### 21. Live results JSON (public)
GET {{host}}/api/monitor/results/{{electionId}}

### 22. Live results page (public, open in a browser)
GET {{host}}/monitor/election/{{electionId}}
